TreeSet
-----------------
key features
------------
✅ Stores data-> unique elements.
✅ order-> Maintains sorted (ascending) order by default.
✅ Uses a Red-Black Tree internally.
✅ Supports natural ordering or custom ordering with a Comparator.
❌ Does not preserve insertion order.
❌ Does not allow null.
⏱️ add(), remove(), and contains() are O(log n).
✅ Provides navigation methods like first(), last(), higher(), lower(), ceiling(), and floor().

