| Interface         | Input | Output  |
| ----------------- | ----- | ------- |
| Predicate<T>      | 1     | boolean |
| Consumer<T>       | 1     | void    |
| Supplier<T>       | 0     | T       |
| Function<T,R>     | 1     | R       |
| UnaryOperator<T>  | 1     | T       |
| BinaryOperator<T> | 2     | T       |
| BiPredicate<T,U>  | 2     | boolean |
| BiConsumer<T,U>   | 2     | void    |
| BiFunction<T,U,R> | 2     | R       |
